      "children": [
       { "id": "mp-b2h3", "type": "headline", "settings": { "heading": "Restraint as luxury", "tag": "h3", "heading_font": "heading", "heading_size": "md", "heading_font_size": "26", "heading_color": "#18181a", "heading_weight": "500", "alignment": "left", "decoration": "none" }, "style": {}, "advanced": {}, "children": [] },
       { "id": "mp-b2p1", "type": "text-block", "settings": { "content": "<p>The hospitality category loves to shout. Marisol wanted the opposite — the confidence of a place that doesn't need to. So we treated silence as a material: wide margins, slow transitions, and a booking flow you can finish in four taps without ever seeing a carousel.</p>", "text_color": "#3a3a3c", "font_size": "19", "line_height": "1.7", "text_align": "left", "max_width": "0" }, "style": {}, "advanced": {}, "children": [] },
       { "id": "mp-b2p2", "type": "text-block", "settings": { "content": "<p>A year on, occupancy is up across all six properties and, more tellingly, guests have started getting the logo tattooed. We're choosing to read that as a good sign.</p>", "text_color": "#3a3a3c", "font_size": "19", "line_height": "1.7", "text_align": "left", "max_width": "0" }, "style": {}, "advanced": {}, "children": [] }
      ]
     },
     { "id": "mp-co-b2sp2", "type": "column", "settings": { "width": "1-6" }, "style": {}, "advanced": {}, "children": [] }
    ]
   }
  ]
